      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "nushi_dragon_0005_friend_04",
      "hash64": "C33E4285F4442DE4",
      "text": "Must be some kinda truly terrifying beast...\\c\\nBut how are we supposed to search for a thing\\nwhen we don’t even know what it looks like?\\c\\nSure would be handy if it just ran around crying\\n“I’m the Titan!” or something—if only, right![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
